      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"37893\">@Ofer</user-mention>,</p><p>Set CURRENT_SHUNT_UP to \"PA3\" (OPAMP1) and CURRENT_SHUNT_WP to “PB12, PB14, PB13” (OPAMP2).<br/>Set the “polarizationOffset” and “offsetNetworkAttenuation” parameter values.<br/>Verify the other “amplifying” and shunt parameter values.</p></div>"
